OL,3,GNEWSAMore arrests in #1m university
OL,4,Afraud investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo more arrests have been made in an
OL,7,Finvestigation into #1m of alleged
OL,8,Ffinancial irregularities at the
OL,9,FUniversity of Greater Manchester,
OL,10,Fformerly named the University of
OL,11,FBolton, between 2014 and 2025.
OL,13,FTwo men, in their 50s and 60s, have
OL,14,Fbeen arrested on suspicion of witness
OL,15,Fintimidation, perverting the course of
OL,16,Fjustice and fraud by the abuse of
OL,17,Fposition after raids in Bolton and
OL,18,FSouth Yorkshire, Greater Manchester
OL,19,FPolice (GMP) said.
