OL,7,Fon suspicion of money laundering in
OL,8,FJuly, along with another man and a
OL,9,Fwoman.
OL,11,FGMP said it was "exploring evidence
OL,12,Findicating over #1m worth of fraudulent
OL,13,Factivity", including 60 transactions
OL,14,Fand more than a million emails.
